# ChainerTrader Project Overview

ChainerTrader is a Python-based algorithmic trading system that implements TradingView algorithms from the YouTube channel "Shi Hun". The project provides backtesting, live trading, and analysis capabilities for cryptocurrency markets.

## Core Architecture

The main entry point is [src/trader/__main__.py](mdc:src/trader/__main__.py), which delegates to [src/trader/app/main.py](mdc:src/trader/app/main.py) for command-line argument parsing and application initialization.

The central application class is [src/trader/app/app.py](mdc:src/trader/app/app.py), which orchestrates all components:
- **Configuration Management**: [src/trader/common/config.py](mdc:src/trader/common/config.py)
- **Database Management**: [src/trader/app/database_manager.py](mdc:src/trader/app/database_manager.py)
- **Exchange Integration**: [src/trader/binance_exchange/exchange.py](mdc:src/trader/binance_exchange/exchange.py)
- **Task Management**: [src/trader/task/task_manager.py](mdc:src/trader/task/task_manager.py)
- **Statistics & Reporting**: [src/trader/statistics/statistics.py](mdc:src/trader/statistics/statistics.py)
- **Notification System**: [src/trader/notify/notify_manager.py](mdc:src/trader/notify/notify_manager.py)

## Key Features

- **Multiple Trading Strategies**: Based on backtrader framework
- **Binance Integration**: Real-time data and trading
- **MongoDB Support**: Data persistence and analysis
- **Web API**: RESTful interface for remote control
- **Backtesting Engine**: Historical strategy validation
- **Real-time Notifications**: Email and other notification methods

## Project Structure

- `src/trader/`: Main package containing all trading logic
- `data/`: Sample market data files (CSV format)
- `docs/`: Documentation and strategy guides
- `scripts/`: Configuration files for different tasks
- `tests/`: Unit tests and integration tests
